OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry start with bright
OL,6,Fspells though some showers developing
OL,7,Faround midday. These could turn heavy
OL,8,Fat times, with the risk of thunder.
OL,9,FShowers moving away eastwards by the
OL,10,Flate afternoon, allowing skies to
OL,11,Fbrighten again. Temperatures around
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FTurning drier for a time
OL,15,Fovernight with clear spells, before
OL,16,Ffurther lighter showers move in from
OL,17,Fthe west through the early hours. A
OL,18,Fcool night for some.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
