OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FSome sunshine and just the
OL,6,Fodd shower initially. However, heavy
OL,7,Fthundery showers move southwards
OL,8,Fthrough the morning and into the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Turning a little lighter
OL,10,Flater on. Cooler than Wednesday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,14,Finto the weekend. Isolated showers
OL,15,Fcontinuing but becoming more settled
OL,16,Fagain by Sunday with sunny spells
OL,17,Fthroughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
